# Application Middleware

This folder contains Express middleware shared across application routes and requests.

- `logger.middleware.ts` exports the configured Pino HTTP request logger for Express middleware registration.
- `checkMethod.middleware.ts` rejects requests that use HTTP methods outside the supported method list with a typed 405 error.
- `error.middleware.ts` handles uncaught route errors and sends the standard typed error response. Request logging and status-based log levels are handled by `logger.middleware.ts`.

Update this guide when middleware files or responsibilities change.
